      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Have you ever been part of an admissions committee? Set up your own admissions pipeline? Have you before been the arbiter of character, the judge of talent, your finger poised above a “yes” or a “no”?",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Have you ever been part of an admissions committee? Set up your own admissions pipeline? Have you before been the arbiter of character, the judge of talent, your finger poised above a “yes” or a “no”?",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "419a6e41-f23e-8080-a20f-e6a287b17d3b",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "419a6e41-f23e-8080-aa43-ed67b046bb5f"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-11-15T23:21:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-11-15T23:34:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "I have, and, it sucks. Reviewing applications is corrosive to the soul. I’m asked to strip away someone’s essential humanity, reducing them down to a question of whether they are useful or valuable, whether they are fit for inclusion. I don’t understand how one is supposed to engage in this process without emerging, fundamentally altered, more instrumental and less compassionate.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "I have, and, it sucks. Reviewing applications is corrosive to the soul. I’m asked to strip away someone’s essential humanity, reducing them down to a question of whether they are useful or valuable, whether they are fit for inclusion. I don’t understand how one is supposed to engage in this process without emerging, fundamentally altered, more instrumental and less compassionate.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "419a6e41-f23e-8069-ab77-ddf4b0660da1",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "419a6e41-f23e-8080-aa43-ed67b046bb5f"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-11-15T23:34:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-11-15T23:34:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
