    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "41ba6e41-f23e-80c4-8784-ee2cfcb4a1bd",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "419a6e41-f23e-8080-aa43-ed67b046bb5f"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-11-17T03:17:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-11-17T04:04:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "The parable of the talents haunts me. (Partly because I’m not sure which of the servants I am — have I been given five talents? two? one? How much of a return is expected of me?)",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "The parable of the talents haunts me. (Partly because I’m not sure which of the servants I am — have I been given five talents? two? one? How much of a return is expected of me?)",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "41ba6e41-f23e-800e-bb41-eba8e0d058b1",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "419a6e41-f23e-8080-aa43-ed67b046bb5f"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-11-17T03:32:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-11-17T04:35:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "But mostly because it paints a picture of an unforgiving master, him who judges his servants based on their outcomes, and casts the unsuccessful ones into hell. Even if I can make my own quota, I’d like to think that my peers will be forgiven theirs. But this does not seem to be the moral of the story. Rather, the moral seems to be, “",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "But mostly because it paints a picture of an unforgiving master, him who judges his servants based on their outcomes, and casts the unsuccessful ones into hell. Even if I can make my own quota, I’d like to think that my peers will be forgiven theirs. But this does not seem to be the moral of the story. Rather, the moral seems to be, “",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "41ba6e41-f23e-801c-b625-eedc96d68c82",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "419a6e41-f23e-8080-aa43-ed67b046bb5f"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-11-17T03:11:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-11-17T04:36:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "I do have some sympathy for the plight of the master. In fact, I now sit atop some resources which are scarce. My orgs have a limited amount of money with which to hire people. My spaces and events can only fit so many folks. And my own time and focus becomes scarcer and scarcer. These days, every time I meet someone new, I suspect that another slips out of my context window.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "I do have some sympathy for the plight of the master. In fact, I now sit atop some resources which are scarce. My orgs have a limited amount of money with which to hire people. My spaces and events can only fit so many folks. And my own time and focus becomes scarcer and scarcer. These days, every time I meet someone new, I suspect that another slips out of my context window.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "41ba6e41-f23e-8019-8ef1-d0aa3117eea2",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "419a6e41-f23e-8080-aa43-ed67b046bb5f"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-11-17T03:28:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-11-17T04:36:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "So: maybe it sounds noble to never have to choose, never have to prioritize. But maybe this a dereliction of duty?",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "So: maybe it sounds noble to never have to choose, never have to prioritize. But maybe this a dereliction of duty?",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "41ba6e41-f23e-8095-8895-f286991a7118",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "419a6e41-f23e-8080-aa43-ed67b046bb5f"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-11-17T03:16:00.000Z",
