      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "I actually kind of think I’m good at judging people. I think my taste is pretty good. I feel like I can speak with someone, and more quickly than most, have a sense of where they will fit in and where they won’t; how they can lend their skills, whether they are well placed to help with this grand project of saving the world.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "I actually kind of think I’m good at judging people. I think my taste is pretty good. I feel like I can speak with someone, and more quickly than most, have a sense of where they will fit in and where they won’t; how they can lend their skills, whether they are well placed to help with this grand project of saving the world.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "41ba6e41-f23e-80c1-8834-e3e75d77d3a3",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "419a6e41-f23e-8080-aa43-ed67b046bb5f"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-11-17T04:37:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-11-17T04:48:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "In the best cases, this is symbiotic, maniacal even, me seeing the spark in somebody else and sending it to kindle, them somehow trusting that I saw truly; believing in the me that believes in them. All the worst cases, then, involve having to turn people away. But perhaps there’s another way?",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "In the best cases, this is symbiotic, maniacal even, me seeing the spark in somebody else and sending it to kindle, them somehow trusting that I saw truly; believing in the me that believes in them. All the worst cases, then, involve having to turn people away. But perhaps there’s another way?",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
